 *       (k is the row, j is the column): physical index is k*NJ + j.
 *       We store it as B(j, k), so B(j, k) == B_in[k][j], and the
 *       j-dimension is the contiguous (stride‑1) dimension. This is
 *       friendly for vectorization along j.
