    //   C: NI x NJ => (width = nj, height = ni)  stored as C(j, i)
    //   A: NI x NK => (width = nk, height = ni)  stored as A(k, i)
    //   B: NK x NJ => (width = nj, height = nk)  stored as B(j, k)
